# AIDC Studio container build context (neutralization stream N3, 2026-09-15; LICENSE-AUDIT H4, M9, R-1.6).
# Docker matches these patterns from the build-context root ("data" = ./data only; use "**/" for any depth).
# The image needs only package manifests, packages/*/src, apps/*/src, apps/web (index.html, public/, vite config),
# engines/ (export templates) and the root licence files. Everything below is excluded.

.git
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/*.log
**/.DS_Store

# private data, local third-party downloads, research and audit papers
data
assets
docs
tools
screenshots
**/__screenshots__
**/deck-p*.png

# Python / engine caches
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
**/.venv
**/.godot

# tests and fixtures are not part of the image
packages/*/test
apps/*/test
vitest.config.ts

# local orchestration files
docker-compose.yml
pyrightconfig.json
